.TH AIO-WUI 1 "August 2026" "aio 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
aio-wui \- aio web user interface
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B aio --wui
.RI [ port ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Serves the web interface and JSON API on localhost. The default port is
8080; pass a port as the first argument to override it
.RB ( "aio --wui 8090" ).
.SH WEB UI
Four cards, one per game source:
.TP
.B Built-in Pygame Games
example games, click to launch.
.TP
.B PyPI Pygame Packages
packages, click to launch.
.TP
.B GitHub Pygame Repos
repositories with star counts, click to launch.
.TP
.B Awesome Pygame List
curated repositories, click to launch.
.PP
A control panel provides a name/number input with
.B Launch
and
.B Install
buttons.
.SH ENDPOINTS
.TP
.B GET /
The web UI.
.TP
.B GET /api/launch?name=<name-or-number>
Launch the named or numbered game and return a message.
.TP
.B GET /api/install?name=<name-or-number>
Install the named or numbered game and return a message.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR aio (1),
.BR aio-gui (1),
.BR aio-suite (7)
.SH AUTHOR
Jimmy + opencode
